From: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:11:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] dt-bindings: soc: apple: rtk-helper-asc4: allow a
 second DART stream

The MTP helper shares its IOMMU group with the DockChannel HID transport, and
apple_dart_device_group() needs every stream of a device in one group, so the
helper lists the same two streams as the transport. Allow two iommus entries.

Signed-off-by: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit f54655bfafc595528e28250be27ac50c4dca3262)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,rtk-helper-asc4.yaml   | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,rtk-helper-asc4.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,rtk-helper-asc4.yaml
index 874f667ce3..ab3bf9925a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,rtk-helper-asc4.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,rtk-helper-asc4.yaml
@@ -63,7 +63,8 @@ properties:
     maxItems: 1
 
   iommus:
-    maxItems: 1
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 2
 
   apple,rtkit-handoff:
     enum:
-- 
